writing a future timestamp.

For an accepted term, the grantor computes:

```text
deadline = local-acceptance-instant
         + accepted-duration
         + grantor-tolerance
```

Tolerance is grantor policy and does not alter the accepted duration carried
in the fact. Two observers may choose different tolerances and legitimately
